/E (WHAT WOULD THE FEASIBILITY STUDY TELL US?)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (A feasibility study would provide information the Board would need to evaluate whether pursuing electric service is in the best interest of Kitsap County residents. Areas of analysis could include infrastructure and engineering requirements, power supply, costs and financing, rates and revenue, staffing and operations, legal and regulatory requirements, and other factors.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
