/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (KPUD is a public municipal corporation governed by locally elected commissioners. Board meetings are open to the public, and KPUD is subject to Washington's public records and public meetings laws. The current electric provider is an investor-owned utility regulated by the Washington Utilities and Transportation Commission.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
202 0 obj
<<
