/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (Bonneville Power Administration \(BPA\) currently transmits power to Kitsap County and works with public power utilities across Washington. Under federal law, BPA has an obligation to supply power to public utilities that request it, subject to applicable requirements and available resources. BPA is one potential resource that could be evaluated as part of a future feasibility study, but no decision has been made about where KPUD would purchase or obtain power.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
