/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
/E (Washington law \(RCW 54.16.020\) gives public utility districts authority to acquire electric facilities through negotiated purchase or, when necessary, through a legal process overseen by the courts. Any acquisition would be subject to the requirements of state law, including a determination of the property's fair value.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 86 0 R
