/P 86 0 R
/E (There is no timeline for beginning electric service at this time. If voters approve Proposition 1, KPUD would first conduct a comprehensive feasibility study. The time required to establish electric service would depend on the findings of that study and subsequent decisions by the Board. For context, PUDs that have established electric service have typically required several years to begin operations. Jefferson Public Utility District, the most recent Washington PUD to begin providing electric service, took approximately five years.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
